{"title":"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Vernon starts with a first number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/c/d3c5af2bc6357095dadd99e0affe1d7e55ff97f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; n &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" />. Vernon enters the first number into a machine to produce a second number. He then enters the second number back into the machine to produce a third number. Vernon continually enters the result back into the machine giving a chain of numbers.<br />\nWhen Vernon enters a number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> into the machine,\n</p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/a/c5af9f74a0405bc6a03c28c1027d600d2d8d1ea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\leq \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"37\" />, the machine outputs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec701493fa72dda5d6747fe14f30e7b1c2fb6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />, and</li>\n<li>if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/1/531a444af0c90ec019ce0b71347f1099f98b8b39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, the machine outputs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/b/fab3a1775dce2c1673f4dcf6b0aa63cea849ecea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(1 - x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"67\" height=\"20\" />.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If the machine ever produces the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, Vernon stops the process.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part A (page does not exist)\">2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part A</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_B&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part B (page does not exist)\">2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part B</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part C (page does not exist)\">2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part C</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_D&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part D (page does not exist)\">2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part D</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC\" title=\"2012 CIMC\">2012 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Part B Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" styl